---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PixieDust from '../../components/PixieDust.jsx';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Unlimited $100 Referral Bonus Program"
  description="Earn unlimited $100 bonuses by referring customers to Shelby Web Company. Start earning passive income today. Terms apply."
>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-32 px-4" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <p class="text-brand-glow text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">✦ Unlimited Earning Opportunity</p>
      <div class="relative inline-block">
        <PixieDust client:load />
        <h1 class="font-heading text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-bold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
          Earn <span class="bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-accent via-brand-yellow to-brand-accent">$100 Per Referral</span>
        </h1>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xl text-brand-sky/80 mb-8">
        There's no limit on how much you can earn. Share Shelby Web Company with your network and get paid for every successful referral.
      </p>
      <a 
        href="/contact/"
        class="inline-block bg-brand-accent text-[#0A0A0A] px-8 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-brand-accent-light transition-all"
      >
        Join the Program
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How It Works -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-brand-darkest border-y border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">How It Works</h2>
        <p class="text-brand-sky/70 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg">
          Four simple steps to start earning passive income from your referrals.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-brand-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 relative">
          <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-brand-cyan/30 text-3xl font-bold">01</div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-accent to-brand-yellow rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-[#0A0A0A] font-bold text-xl">
            1
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Get Your Referral Link</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/60">Sign up for the program and receive your unique referral link. Share it with as many people as you want.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 relative">
          <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-brand-cyan/30 text-3xl font-bold">02</div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-accent to-brand-yellow rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-[#0A0A0A] font-bold text-xl">
            2
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">They Click & Learn</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/60">Your referral clicks your link and explores our services. They learn about what we offer at no obligation.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 relative">
          <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-brand-cyan/30 text-3xl font-bold">03</div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-accent to-brand-yellow rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-[#0A0A0A] font-bold text-xl">
            3
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">They Hire Us</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/60">If they book a project with us, the referral is credited to your account and locked in.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 relative">
          <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-brand-cyan/30 text-3xl font-bold">04</div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-accent to-brand-yellow rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-[#0A0A0A] font-bold text-xl">
            4
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">You Get Paid</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/60">Once their project is completed, we send you $100. Repeat as many times as you want.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Refer Us -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Why Your Network Will Love Us</h2>
        <p class="text-brand-sky/70 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg">
          When you refer someone to Shelby Web Company, you're recommending proven expertise.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-brand-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-lime-400 to-lime-600 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(132,204,22,0.3)] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-brand-darkest text-brand-darkest">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Lightning-Fast Results</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/60">We deliver high-performance websites optimized for speed, conversions, and search rankings from day one.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-lime-400 to-lime-600 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(132,204,22,0.3)] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-brand-darkest text-brand-darkest">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m7 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Trustworthy & Transparent</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/60">We communicate clearly, deliver on our promises, and treat every client's business like it's our own.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-lime-400 to-lime-600 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(132,204,22,0.3)] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-brand-darkest text-brand-darkest">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Better Value Than Big Agencies</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/60">We offer personalized service, fair pricing, and genuine care—without the corporate overhead markup.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Earnings Scenarios -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-brand-dark/50 border-y border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-16 text-center">Earnings Scenarios</h2>
      
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-brand-darkest p-8 rounded-xl border border-brand-accent/20">
          <p class="text-brand-accent text-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mb-4">Conservative</p>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
            <span class="text-brand-accent">$500</span><span class="text-brand-sky/60 text-lg">/month</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/70 mb-6">
            5 referrals per month × $100 = $500/month ($6,000/year)
          </p>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/60 text-sm">Realistic for sharing within a small circle of business contacts.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-darkest p-8 rounded-xl border border-brand-accent/50 relative">
          <div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-brand-accent text-[#0A0A0A] px-4 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold">POPULAR</div>
          <p class="text-brand-accent text-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mb-4">Active Referrer</p>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
            <span class="text-brand-accent">$1,500</span><span class="text-brand-sky/60 text-lg">/month</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/70 mb-6">
            15 referrals per month × $100 = $1,500/month ($18,000/year)
          </p>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/60 text-sm">Strong earnings by regularly recommending us to your network.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-darkest p-8 rounded-xl border border-brand-accent/20">
          <p class="text-brand-accent text-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mb-4">Full-Time Referrer</p>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
            <span class="text-brand-accent">$3,000+</span><span class="text-brand-sky/60 text-lg">/month</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/70 mb-6">
            30+ referrals per month × $100 = $3,000+/month ($36,000+/year)
          </p>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/60 text-sm">Unlimited potential for dedicated affiliates with larger networks.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-center text-brand-sky/60 text-sm mt-8 italic">*Earnings vary based on referral volume. These are examples only.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Program Benefits -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-16 text-center">Program Benefits</h2>
      
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="text-brand-accent text-2xl flex-shrink-0 font-bold">✓</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">No Commission Cap</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-sky/70">There's no limit to how many referrals you can make or how much you can earn. The more you share, the more you make.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="text-brand-accent text-2xl flex-shrink-0 font-bold">✓</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Quick Payouts</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-sky/70">We pay $100 promptly after each referred project completes. Fast, reliable payments you can count on.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="text-brand-accent text-2xl flex-shrink-0 font-bold">✓</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Lifetime Link</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-sky/70">Your referral link is permanent. Use it forever and track all your earnings in one dashboard.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="text-brand-accent text-2xl flex-shrink-0 font-bold">✓</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Marketing Support</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-sky/70">We provide you with promotional materials, graphics, and copy to help you share effectively.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="text-brand-accent text-2xl flex-shrink-0 font-bold">✓</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Easy Dashboard</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-sky/70">Track clicks, conversions, and earnings in real-time. See exactly how your network is performing.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="text-brand-accent text-2xl flex-shrink-0 font-bold">✓</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">No Obligation to Clients</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-sky/70">Your referrals are treated the same as any other potential client. No special treatment, no pressure.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ Section -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-brand-dark/50 border-y border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-16 text-center">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="bg-brand-darkest p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">Do I need to be a business owner to join?</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/70">No. Anyone can join the program—business owners, freelancers, consultants, or just someone with a great network.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-darkest p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">When do I get paid after a referral?</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/70">Payment is made within 30 days after the referred client's project is completed and delivered.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-darkest p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">How do I track my referrals and earnings?</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/70">You'll have access to a personal dashboard where you can see all clicks, conversions, pending payments, and completed payouts in real-time.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-darkest p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">What counts as a qualified referral?</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/70">Any client who clicks your link, contacts us mentioning the referral, and hires us for a project counts. It's that simple.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-darkest p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">Can I promote the referral program on social media?</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/70">Absolutely. Share your link on Facebook, LinkedIn, Instagram, email newsletters—anywhere your audience hangs out.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-darkest p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">Is there a minimum payout amount?</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/70">No minimum. You get paid $100 per referral, whether that's your first payment or your fiftieth.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-darkest p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">What if my referral decides not to hire you?</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/70">No problem. You only earn when your referral actually becomes a client. No payment for clicks or inquiries alone.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-darkest p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">Can I join multiple times or create multiple referral links?</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/70">One account per person. But you can use your single link in multiple places—email, social media, website, etc.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Ready to Start Earning?</h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-brand-sky/80 mb-8">
        Join our referral program today and start building passive income from your network.
      </p>
      <p class="text-brand-sky/60 mb-8 text-sm">
        Know someone starting fresh? Share our <a href="/promotions/free-logo-design/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:text-white underline decoration-brand-cyan/30">free logo design</a> and
        <a href="/promotions/free-seo-audit/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:text-white underline decoration-brand-cyan/30">free SEO audit</a> offers so they get a great launch.
      </p>
      <a 
        href="/contact/"
        class="inline-block bg-brand-accent text-[#0A0A0A] px-8 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-brand-accent-light transition-all text-lg"
      >
        Join the Referral Program
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
